title: "Penumbra: self-hosted deep retrieval for AI agents"
abstract: "A self-hosted deep-retrieval MCP server that reaches the half-lit zone between secrets and the search surface (multi-modal, multi-lingual, walled, and temporal), equipping an AI agent with structured, source-traced, gap-mapped evidence."
